      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;the-simplicity-of-what-is-joan-tollifson&#34;&gt;The Simplicity of What Is Joan Tollifson&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/simplicity_tollifson.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Joan Tollifson&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1553956303/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/1553956303.01.TZZZZZZZ.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/1553956303.01.TZZZZZZZ.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;Buy Joan&amp;rsquo;s latest book, &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1553956303/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;Awake in the Heartland: The Ecstasy of What Is&lt;/a&gt;, awarded 5* by every reviewer at Amazon.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.joantollifson.com/&#34;&gt;Joan Tollifson&amp;rsquo;s Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Seeking the extraordinary, it is easy to overlook the simple and obvious truth. You are here. You know it beyond any doubt. You don&amp;rsquo;t need a mirror or an outside authority to tell you. It is undeniable.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
